{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Guard Ninja 是一款手機防盜警報工具，適合在火車、機場或咖啡店小睡，以及需要暫時放下手機的場合使用。把手機放進行李箱，或放置於錢包、筆記型電腦之上，一旦有人移動或取走物品，應用便會即時啟動警報提醒你。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自訂警報靈活守護財物</h2>\n<p>Guard Ninja 讓你建立可自訂警報，按不同情境選用合適設定。警報行為可混合聲音、閃燈或震動，感應靈敏度亦可調整，決定多大的手機移動才觸發警報。應用提供啟動與關閉計時器，讓你有時間放好手機，並在警報啟動前先行關閉。你更可設定專屬密碼解除警報，警報清單長期顯示於主畫面，隨時啟用其中一個。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-544-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-545-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-546-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-547-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-548-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Guard Ninja</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T01:58:05.241572+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}